# (white keys play chords: four notes each) notes played a touch early, after the count-in's last click, are the take's first beat: one held over the start
# (a pad), one short let go before it (a stab); a note before the last beat is not taken
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
press HOME
tapkey b0
release HOME
tap SEQ
tap SEQ
turn K2 1
turn K2 -1
wait 50
tap REC
wait 1500
key w0 down 90
wait 100
key w0 up
wait 1300
key w2 down 100
wait 100
key w2 up
wait 50
key w4 down 100
wait 600
expect recording 1
key w4 up
wait 1000
tap REC
wait 200
expect events 8
expect firstpos 0
tap PLAY
